# Security (MANDATORY)

## Secrets
- Secrets MUST come from ENV only.
- DO NOT add secrets to code, logs, docs, test fixtures, or commits.
- Ensure .cursorignore and .gitignore cover secrets and credential files.

## Logs / Telemetry
- NEVER log:
  - API keys, tokens, credentials
  - full PII (phone/email/name)
- If needed for debugging: redact or hash.

## External Calls
- Always set timeouts.
- Validate inputs at boundaries.
- Fail gracefully without leaking internal details.

## Cursor Safety
- If a file might contain secrets, keep it excluded via .cursorignore.
